rchived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-03-17T05:40:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T23:26:48Z","closed_at":"2026-04-09T22:48:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117498","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117498","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117498.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117498.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-09T22:48:10Z"},"body":"Closes [#14453](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14453). In theme with #117432.\r\n\r\nFollows #117377 in reclaiming margins:\r\n- Expands the margins of the BlendSpace to the full rect of its panel, then manually insetting them to allow blend points some input headroom for being selected from the overflow side when at the edge, while still visually looking the same.\r\n\r\n| Previously | Now |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| <img width=\"170\" height=\"102\" alt=\"space-previously\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/133f1ced-98e9-47c1-a72a-1561902e02cc\" /> | <img width=\"170\" height=\"102\" alt=\"space-now\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b262c9cf-5438-4940-a240-5c251070698a\" /> | \r\n| Initiating a drag in the red region, outside the blend space grid but inside the panel, even when on the blendpoint, was not possible. So 3/4ths of the blendpoint could be unselectable. | With the margins expanded to fill the panel and the blend space grid inset, initiating a drag is now possible from either side. |\r\n\r\nFollows #110369 in polishing BlendSpace:\r\n1. Give the BlendSpace editor panel the same StyleBox as StateMachine, to make each AnimationTree editor have a consistent tone.\r\n2. Allow overflowing triangles to clip gracefully at the edge of this now-distinct panel.\r\n3. Remove the white 1px lines that represented axes in both BlendSpace editors, and allow the layout to reinforce the axes instead.\r\n4. Remove the blue focus rectangle from BlendSpace1D's, and the nonfunctional one from BlendSpace2D's editor.\r\n5. Change each LineEdit's horizontal orientation to better hug grid position. In BlendSpace1D and BlendSpace2D's x axis, left-center-right for min-label-max. In BlendSpace2D's y axis, right-right-right for min-label-max.\r\n6. Colons were previously removed from labels to reduce clutter in the very busy BlendSpace editor toolbar, and StateMachine's are made to follow suit, for `Transition` and `Play Mode`.\r\n7. The now-unused constructors/destructors in both BlendSpace resources are removed.\r\n8. Finally, an extra commit on top duplicates #117470 to support number 5, in getting out of the way of the numbers as they hug their axes' extremes. If that PR isn't desired, this can be undone.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| <img width=\"1083\" height=\"656\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/244a49bc-67a1-4e7a-ae52-7a7f143ed7bb\" /> | <img width=\"1083\" height=\"656\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e07a43a5-c3f0-485b-a465-ae7982e9760e\" /> | \r\n| <img width=\"1583\" height=\"651\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f151ce3-405e-4258-a2b3-0ee92a0dc1e0\" /> | <img width=\"1583\" height=\"651\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7128e987-31fc-42c8-9824-053b1330157f\" /> |\r\n\r\nAnything else that is deemed extraneous can also be removed. If one of these would be better suited on it's own, let me know.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117498/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117498/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}